| Spec | Detail |
|------|--------|
| Processor | Quad-core RK3568, Cortex-A55, up to 2.0 GHz |
| OS | Android 11.0 |
| Memory | 2 GB / 4 GB / 8 GB DDR; 16 GB / 32 GB / 64 GB / 128 GB eMMC |
