## Development Notes

- Target Android 11 on ARM (Cortex-A55 / RK3568). Avoid APIs unavailable below Android 11.
- The kiosk has a fixed orientation and large touch display — design for landscape or portrait kiosk mode, not handheld phone use.
- The built-in scanner reads both screen-displayed and paper QR/barcodes. Payment codes (Alipay, WeChat) are supported natively.
- Thermal printer uses ESC/POS-compatible commands over serial or USB.
- Available memory may be as low as 2 GB — keep the app memory-efficient.
